    'import.title':'① Haul In the Log','import.hint':'Reads CEF, LEEF, plain Syslog (RFC3164/RFC5424), and FortiGate\'s own key=value charts (no syslog riggin\' needed), line by line, plus JSON/NDJSON charts, and Windows Event Log XML charts (from wevtutil or Event Viewer — no binary .evtx booty, arr). Paste the scroll, hoist a file aboard, or drag one right onto the deck.','nav.tools_btn':'Change Ships','nav.tool_network':'The Helm','nav.tool_switch':'Switch Chart Reader','nav.tool_gen':'Switch Chart Maker','nav.tool_fw':'Fleet Defense','nav.tool_ca':'Treasure Hider','nav.tool_log':'Ship\'s Log Reader','import.paste_placeholder':'Paste yer log scroll here, or hoist a file below…','import.upload_btn':'Hoist File','import.analyze_btn':'Chart & Scan','import.clear_btn':'Swab the Deck','import.file_loaded':'File aboard: ','import.progress_parsing':'Readin\' the scroll…','import.progress_analyzing':'Checkin\' \'gainst the blacklist & sortin\'…','import.progress_rendering':'Drawin\' the chart…','import.progress_correlating':'Chartin\' the chain o\' clues…','import.large_file_notice':'Scroll too big ({name}, {lines} lines) — won\'t show below, but still be read proper','opt.freqWindow':'Bells in a Watch:','opt.freqThreshold':'Ruckus Count:','opt.scanThreshold':"Scoutin' Count:",'opt.volumeThreshold':"Cargo Threshold (MB):",'opt.chainWindow':"Chain Reckonin' (min):",'opt.gapThreshold':"Gap in the Log (min):",'opt.chainGroupBy':"Reckon by:",'opt.chainGroupByIp':"Port o' Call",'opt.chainGroupByUser':"Buccaneer",'opt.geoRiskLabel':"Enemy Waters:",'opt.geoRiskFilter':'Search fer a Land…',
